<title>FINLAND: Finnair Aug passenger load factor falls.</title>
<headline>Finnair Aug passenger load factor falls.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national carrier Finnair Oy said in a statement on Friday its passenger load factor fell 0.1 percentage point year-on-year to 72.5 percent in August.  </p>
<p>Finnair gave the following statistics:</p>
<p>				     Aug 1996    July 1996   Yr/yr(pct)</p>
<p> Passengers (thousand)	     551	   528	  +7.9</p>
<p> RPK (million)			 980	   997	  -0.4</p>
<p> RTK (million)			 107	   110	  -1.8</p>
<p> Cargo and mail (thousand kg)  4,861	 4,911	  -3.2</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (pct)    72.5	  75.1	  -0.1 pts</p>
<p>August 1996 totals broken down by flight type:</p>
<p>			Passengers   RPK	 RTK	    Cargo</p>
<p>			thousand   million    million     thousand kg</p>
<p> International	 305	 713	  83	    4,364</p>
<p> Domestic		170	  74	   7		434</p>
<p> Charter		  76	 192	  17		 63</p>
<p>Load factor (percent) by flight type:</p>
<p>				  Aug 1996   July 1996  Yr/yr (pct pts)</p>
<p> International		  70.7	 72.1	  -1.8</p>
<p> Domestic			 60.0	 64.9	  +5.5</p>
<p>Finnair's financial year runs from April 1 to March 31.</p>
<p>RPK - revenue passenger km (revenue passengers carried multiplied by km flown)</p>
<p>RTK - revenue tonne km (tonnage of revenue load carried -- passengers, cargo and mail -- multiplied by km flown.</p>
<p>Passenger load factor - RPK as a percentage of available seat km</p>
<p>Finnair does not give a cargo load factor.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
